    "Disclaimer: Finsy is a personal bookkeeping tool and is NOT a bank, financial institution, or licensed tax advisor. This statement is generated solely from user-entered records for informational and personal budgeting purposes only.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Disclaimer: Finsy is a personal bookkeeping tool and is NOT a bank, financial institution, or licensed tax advisor. This statement is generated solely from user-entered records for informational and personal budgeting purposes only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "免责声明: Finsy 仅为个人记账管理工具，并非银行、金融机构或注册税务顾问。本账单完全依据用户自行录入的记录生成，仅供个人财务规划参考。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "免責聲明: Finsy 僅為個人記帳管理工具，並非銀行、金融機構或註冊稅務顧問。本帳單完全依據使用者自行輸入的記錄生成，僅供個人財務規劃參考。"
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "免責事項: Finsyは個人の家計管理ツールであり、銀行、金融機関、公認税理士ではありません。本明細書はユーザーが入力した記録のみに基づいて生成され、情報提供および個人の予算管理のみを目的としています。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "면책 조항: Finsy는 개인 가계부 관리 도구이며 은행, 금융 기관 또는 공인 세무사가 아닙니다. 본 명세서는 사용자가 입력한 기록만을 바탕으로 생성되며, 정보 제공 및 개인 예산 관리 목적으로만 사용됩니다."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Disclaimer: Finsy is a personal bookkeeping tool and is NOT a bank, financial institution, or licensed tax advisor. This statement is generated solely from user-entered records for informational and personal budgeting purposes only. This document does not constitute official tax advice.": {
